OL,5,G0000 Taggart
OL,6,     FJardine and the team investigate
OL,7,     Fmurky going-ons at a football club
OL,8,     Fwhose lack of success on the pitch
OL,9,     Fis matched by an unaccountably
OL,10,     Fhigh death rate among its
OL,11,     Femployees.
OL,12,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FThe women are searched before
OL,14,     Ftheir first day at the factory and
OL,15,     FErica warns them not toabuse this
OL,16,     Fprivilege. Paul speaks up for Gail
OL,17,     Fat her committal hearing, but to
OL,18,     Flittle effect.
